      "name": "EpicRealism XL",
      "icon": "📷",
      "previewImage": "previews/epicrealism-xl.jpg",
      "description": "Photorealistic pictures from the version of epiCRealism XL its author calls probably the best.\n\nThe card adds no quality tags. To raise fidelity, the author starts the prompt with: masterpiece, 4k, ray tracing, intricate details, highly-detailed, hyper-realistic, 8k RAW Editorial Photo.\n\nAfter the subject, the author adds: cinematic light, dramatic light, shallow depth of field, high budget, bokeh, cinemascope\n\nFor a film look, add: film grain ISO 200 faded film, 35mm photo, grainy, vignette, vintage, Kodachrome, Lomography, stained, highly detailed, found footage\n\nThe author suggests CFG 2 to 5, with higher values looking more artistic. This card starts just above that at 5.5, so lower CFG for a more photographic result.\n\nLicence: CreativeML Open RAIL++-M with an addendum. Read it on the model's Civitai page before commercial use.\n\nModel format: fp16, not quantized.",
      "tags": [
        "SDXL",
        "Photorealism",
        "Local"
