      "description": "The final SDXL Juggernaut, for photorealism and digital painting, with better poses, hands and feet than earlier versions.\n\nIt is still SDXL. The author warns that text and faces at a distance remain weak.\n\nThe card adds nothing to your prompt and starts with no negative prompt, as the author recommends: add only what you don't want to see.\n\nCFG works from 3 to 6, and lower looks a little more realistic. Steps work from 30 to 40. The author's settings include a 1.5x hi-res pass, which this card does not run.\n\nIt keeps general and mature pictures fairly well apart. For very explicit pictures the author points to the Lustify model instead.\n\nLicence: CreativeML Open RAIL++-M with an addendum. The author says you can merge it, train on it and sell your images, and asks only for a shoutout. Read the addendum on the model's Civitai page before commercial use.\n\nModel format: fp16, not quantized.",
